# Add project specific R8 rules here.
# AGP will combine all keep rule files in src/main/keepRules to pass to R8
#
# For more details, see
#   https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# LiteRT-LM ships no consumer keep rules, and its native library (liblitertlm_jni.so)
# looks up classes, constructors, getters and callback methods of this package by name
# through JNI (e.g. InputData, BenchmarkInfo, EmbeddingResponse, LiteRtLmJniException,
# the Jni*Callback interfaces). Renaming or removing any of them breaks model loading
# and inference at runtime, so the whole package is kept as-is.
-keep class com.google.ai.edge.litertlm.** { *; }
